-<div><img id="img7" src="resources/exif-orientation-7-rl.jpg"><br>Rotated 90&deg; CW and flipped vertically </div>
-<div><img id="img8" src="resources/exif-orientation-8-llo.jpg"><br>Rotated 90&deg; CW</div>
